{%- comment -%}
  Loads the Solar Grown / Retail Partners design system.

  Rendered by every og-* section. Repeating the tag is the standard
  Shopify pattern (Dawn does the same): the browser fetches the file
  once no matter how many sections ask for it.

  No fonts are loaded here. Cormorant Garamond and Inter are already
  served by the theme (theme.liquid + snippets/head-variables.liquid),
  so these pages add no font requests.

  On numbers: every figure that is data (prices, statistics, specifications,
  step numbers) sits in a component set entirely in Inter, so the serif never
  carries one. Digits inside serif running text are left in the serif on
  purpose. An earlier build swapped them to Inter with a unicode-range face
  and it made "18K gold" and "Ring 1" look like typesetting mistakes.
{%- endcomment -%}
